# Per-project mutable runtime state — safety mode (mode.json), timer
# (timer.json), cost tracking (cost-tracking.json), and task-state.sh's
# team-tasks.json (plus its .team-tasks.lock/.lockdir lock files) all live
# here and mutate on every transition, same as session-log.jsonl above.
# Several skills (careful, timer, wrap-up) already document this directory
# as gitignored — this makes it actually so.
.claude/state/

